revm-wasm
=========

An UNOFFICIAL WebAssembly binding for revm. Not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
maintained by the revm project.

The published `revm.wasm` artifact contains compiled code from revm and its
dependency tree. revm is not vendored or forked in this repository; it is a
pinned git dependency and is compiled unmodified.


